/****** UP-Panel.mcc/UPA_Panel_Tokens ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Panel_Tokens -- attribute of UP-Panel.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       Const uint32_t*: theme token array
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Panel_Tokens - access I. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Panel.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Panel.mcc/UPA_Panel_Role ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Panel_Role -- attribute of UP-Panel.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       UPV_Panel_Role_*
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Panel_Role - access I. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Panel.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Panel.mcc/UPA_Panel_Self ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Panel_Self -- attribute of UP-Panel.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       Object*: the panel itself. A MUI Group passes an unknown OM_GET on
*       to its children, so a UPA_Panel_Role answer counts only when
*       UPA_Panel_Self names the object that was asked.
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Panel_Self - access G. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Panel.mcc, UPA_Panel_Role
*
******/

/****** UP-Panel.mcc/UPA_Panel_FixedWidth ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Panel_FixedWidth -- attribute of UP-Panel.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG > 0: fixed width and height, no inner padding
*
